{"steam_appid":3883570,"steam_name":"Invokyr","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3883570/1440951581/c10edb2a67124f025d2e39a9237572856a9cd9ca/1791392281/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1791445529","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257450945/c32515550b8509bbb293c1b283d7aa2311a2e43a/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1791445529","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883570/431a16b39f728e0db989db171e23607db8bbecf1/ss_431a16b39f728e0db989db171e23607db8bbecf1.1920x1080.jpg?t=1792307731","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883570/343c53ef3c2d2fc26dbb22ec8ddd893d26f3ffe0/ss_343c53ef3c2d2fc26dbb22ec8ddd893d26f3ffe0.1920x1080.jpg?t=1792307731","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883570/ad9c2a4218ed3793b7e52c1e2a2fe4d10a0a39b0/ss_ad9c2a4218ed3793b7e52c1e2a2fe4d10a0a39b0.1920x1080.jpg?t=1792307731","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883570/0015a567807cec0f6ed83461f92f5c5277b5476d/ss_0015a567807cec0f6ed83461f92f5c5277b5476d.1920x1080.jpg?t=1792307731","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883570/3c4b51d5f97f46fc7560ed000a176321c9723635/ss_3c4b51d5f97f46fc7560ed000a176321c9723635.1920x1080.jpg?t=1792307731"],"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Every Roll Summons a New Surprise!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883570/extras/387afacabc6e34977402eaa51c77e6ad.poster.avif?t=1792307731\" width=1170 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883570/extras/387afacabc6e34977402eaa51c77e6ad.webm?t=1792307731\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883570/extras/387afacabc6e34977402eaa51c77e6ad.mp4?t=1792307731\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’re trapped. The house groans around you. Cold. Dark. On the table sits a 1970s board game, dusty but humming with energy. You’d heard rumours, of course. About the board, the house. You look to your friends, and a voice, whimsical yet bitter, speaks: <i>“Let’s play a game.”</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once a beloved toy, the Gamemaster now rules this abandoned house. Escape is possible but only if you play. You roll the dice, and another worldly sound echoes through the house. Will you win your freedom or be dragged into the darkness?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Beat the Gamemaster</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883570/extras/46824586b4b7294b7d6aa794fcd2bb9f.poster.avif?t=1792307731\" width=1170 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883570/extras/46824586b4b7294b7d6aa794fcd2bb9f.webm?t=1792307731\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883570/extras/46824586b4b7294b7d6aa794fcd2bb9f.mp4?t=1792307731\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play the game and survive the unpredictable terrors, traps, and curses that are summoned. Reach the end and you’ll escape. Perhaps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Face the Fear Together</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883570/extras/eda4d883b245edbad93bb62afa853c22.poster.avif?t=1792307731\" width=1170 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883570/extras/eda4d883b245edbad93bb62afa853c22.webm?t=1792307731\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883570/extras/eda4d883b245edbad93bb62afa853c22.mp4?t=1792307731\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online co-op with up to 6 players. Work together… or leave someone behind. Death is not always the end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore to Find Dice</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883570/extras/c5278223754ea847391531833612c57b.poster.avif?t=1792307731\" width=1170 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883570/extras/c5278223754ea847391531833612c57b.webm?t=1792307731\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883570/extras/c5278223754ea847391531833612c57b.mp4?t=1792307731\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scour the house to recover the dice hidden within. Each can only be used once. Choose wisely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Special Dice</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some dice offer powers to heal, hide, or hinder those who hunt you, but nothing comes without risk.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Try Not to Get Lost</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883570/extras/6b7e6cdd67630c17b3871cc1803330bb.poster.avif?t=1792307731\" width=1170 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883570/extras/6b7e6cdd67630c17b3871cc1803330bb.webm?t=1792307731\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883570/extras/6b7e6cdd67630c17b3871cc1803330bb.mp4?t=1792307731\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The house is a labyrinth of rooms. Lose your way, and you may never make it back to the board.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fear-filled Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a co-op psychological horror, built around a cursed game that is desperate to be played.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face bizarre, unique creatures: each with their own way of hunting.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traps, curses, and chaos await every turn.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The house has different biomes: jungle, ice mountain, oversized toy chest.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive to earn rewards… and unlock more formidable challenges. Will you play again?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Come, friends, and play.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Live or die, who could say?</strong></p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 64-bit Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Inter Core i5-7500 Or AMD Ryzen 5 1600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GeForce GTX 1650 Or AMD Radeon RX 580<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 64-bit Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-11500 Or AMD Ryzen 5 5600X<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GeForce RTX 3060 Or AMD Radeon RX 6600 XT<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space</li></ul>","genres":["Action","Adventure","Indie","Simulation","Free To Play","Early Access"],"developers":["Ludogram"],"publishers":["Ludogram","Shochiku"],"release_date":"Oct 8, 2026"}